          "short": "$n(n+1)$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(n+1)!}{(n-1)!}&=\\frac{(n+1)n(n-1)!}{(n-1)!}\\\\&=n(n+1)\\end{aligned}$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 21
      },
      {
