        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{1}{n(n-1)}$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(n-2)!}{n!}&=\\frac{(n-2)!}{n(n-1)(n-2)!}\\\\&=\\frac{1}{n(n-1)}\\end{aligned}$",
